, and “Have you noticed how many of your neighbors are using Herman Miller furniture these days?” If only you could really travel back in time and pick up a few chairs for your </div>\n</div><p>Giá sản phẩm trên Tiki đã bao gồm thuế theo luật hiện hành. Bên cạnh đó, tuỳ vào loại sản phẩm, hình thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/25/b3/6f/8b5b589955747584975b7f07569df2d2.png","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/25/b3/6f/8b5b589955747584975b7f07569df2d2.png","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/25/b3/6f/8b5b589955747584975b7f07569df2d2.png","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/25/b3/6f/8b5b589955747584975b7f07569df2d2.png","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/25/b3/6f/8b5b589955747584975b7f07569df2d2.png"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/2c/50/a0/705b5a43196d212b76a9c6d65401284e.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/2c/50/a0/705b5a43196d212b76a9c6d65401284e.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/2c/50/a0/705b5a43196d212b76a9c6d65401284e.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/2c/50/a0/705b5a43196d212b76a9c6d65401284e.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/2c/50/a0/705b5a43196d212b76a9c6d65401284e.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/05/f8/42/02d1ddf371e1e3793ec78a132fa373b1.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/05/f8/42/02d1ddf371e1e3793ec78a132fa373b1.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/05/f8/42/02d1ddf371e1e3793ec78a